          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes, and it is the fastest way to cover balusters, lattice and railings. But spraying alone leaves stain sitting on the surface rather than in the grain, so every sprayed area still has to be back-brushed. Sprayed and unbrushed decks are the most common blotchy, tacky failures.",
